<DTA TYPE="STRING">Superseding<BRK/>UFGS-01 45 00.00 10 (November 2016)<BRK/>UFGS-01 45 00.00 20 (November 2011)<BRK/>UFGS-01 45 00.05 20 (June 2015)<BRK/>UFGS-01 45 00.10 20 (February 2010)</DTA>
